{"type":"message","id":"c160d2a6","parentId":"dbdebb79","timestamp":"2026-02-18T03:42:55.737Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-02-18 09:12 GMT+5:30] Diagnose why OpenClaw gateway crashes/shuts down instead of staying running.\n\n**Investigation checklist:**\n1. Look for lock files in `.openclaw-state/` (e.g., `openclaw.lock`) — delete if stale\n2. Check config for obvious errors (run `openclaw doctor --non-interactive`)\n3. Identify if gateway process dies immediately after start (check process list)\n4. Determine if it's a model loading issue (OpenRouter 429 causing hang)\n5. Check port 18789 conflicts\n\n**Deliverable:** Write a short report `gateway-crash-findings.md` with:\n- Root cause (what you found)\n- Exact fix applied (code or config changes)\n- Verification: `openclaw gateway restart` should keep it running\n\nKeep it concise; only fix what's clearly broken. Use safe changes. Report back with findings."}],"timestamp":1771386175733}}
